{
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "chapter": 3,
  "bookEnglish": "Psalms",
  "bookChineseSimplified": "诗篇",
  "bookChineseTraditional": "詩篇",
  "verses": [
    {
      "verse": "1",
      "en": {
        "text": "LORD, how my adversaries have increased! are those who rise up against me.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "耶和华啊，我的敌人何其加增；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "耶和華啊，我的敵人何其加增；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "2",
      "en": {
        "text": "Many there are who say of my soul, There is no help for him in God.”",
        "footnotes": [
          {
            "id": "f1",
            "text": "3:2 The Hebrew word rendered “God” is “אֱלֹהִ֑ים*” (Elohim)."
          }
        ],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "有许多人议论我说：",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "有許多人議論我說：",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "3",
      "en": {
        "text": "But you, LORD, are a shield around me, my glory, and the one who lifts up my head.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "但你—耶和华是我四围的盾牌，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "但你－耶和華是我四圍的盾牌，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "4",
      "en": {
        "text": "I cry to the LORD with my voice, and he answers me out of his holy hill.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我用我的声音求告耶和华，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我用我的聲音求告耶和華，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "5",
      "en": {
        "text": "I laid myself down and slept. I awakened, for the LORD sustains me.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我躺下睡觉，我醒着，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我躺下睡覺，我醒着，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "6",
      "en": {
        "text": "I will not be afraid of tens of thousands of people who have set themselves against me on every side.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "虽有成万的百姓来周围攻击我，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "雖有成萬的百姓來周圍攻擊我，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "7",
      "en": {
        "text": "Arise, LORD! me, my God! For you have struck all of my enemies on the cheek bone. You have broken the teeth of the wicked.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "耶和华啊，求你起来！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "耶和華啊，求你起來！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "8",
      "en": {
        "text": "Salvation belongs to the LORD. May your blessing be on your people.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "救恩属乎耶和华；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "救恩屬乎耶和華；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    }
  ]
}